{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holy Hoop is a basketball game, get the highest score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a random basketball drop every 3 hours to grow your playable collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How does the Holy Hoop 3 hour drop pool work?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First a collection is selected. (Collections are in the drop pool for a limited time and may not return once removed.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the rarity is selected:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud-Touched (Common)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyborn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lastly a wear rating is picked:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playground Survivor (Worst)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street-Worn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game-Tested</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Court Ready</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pristine Bounce</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once dropped, basketballs can be played with in game, or traded, or sold through Steams Inventory Service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basketball in a heavenly court</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basketball Skins using Steams Inventory Service</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends Leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3479160?t=1756906213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756906213",